\* TIER-2 CERT LEG — Mutation 2 (ResetTruncates = FALSE). EXPECT: VIOLATION.
\*
\* Designed harm: RESET_RECOVERY_ATTEMPT degraded to a label-only r-bump => `CaseBPure`
\* is violated after catch-up (8-state trace at the large bounds, §6). Checks the full
\* `Inv` (the authoritative gate's shape), not the single conjunct the smoke config uses.
\*
\* @MAXMSGS@ is substituted by the tlc-cert workflow from the `cert_msgs` dispatch input.
SPECIFICATION Spec

SYMMETRY Sym

CONSTRAINT
CertConstraint

CONSTANTS
Stages = {s1, s2}
MaxEpoch = 1
MaxRId = 1
MaxAttempt = 2
MaxPos = 1
MaxCrashes = 1
MaxMsgs = @MAXMSGS@
EnableUnservable = TRUE
ResetTruncates = FALSE
AttemptFencing = TRUE
AbortGuardEnabled = TRUE

INVARIANTS
Inv
